# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Codex {#codex}"
msgstr "Codex {#codex}"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Cursor {#cursor}"
msgstr "Cursor {#cursor}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Install from the Cursor marketplace if available, or use the [Skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) above with `--agent cursor`. See [Cursor plugins docs](https://cursor.com/docs/plugins) for more information.\n"
msgstr "Instala desde el marketplace de Cursor si está disponible, o usa la [CLI de skills](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) mencionada arriba con `--agent cursor`. Consulta la [documentación de plugins de Cursor](https://cursor.com/docs/plugins) para más información.\n"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Bob {#ibm-bob}"
msgstr "IBM Bob {#ibm-bob}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Bob has no plugin/marketplace step — it reads `SKILL.md` files directly from `.bob/skills/` in a cloned project. The repository symlinks the skills to `.bob/skills/<name>`  so cloning the repo is sufficient.\n"
msgstr "Bob no tiene un paso de plugin/marketplace: lee los archivos `SKILL.md` directamente desde `.bob/skills/` en un proyecto clonado. El repositorio enlaza simbólicamente las skills a `.bob/skills/<name>`  por lo que clonar el repositorio es suficiente.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can also install with the [Skills CLI](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) above with `--agent bob`.\n"
msgstr "También puedes instalar con la [CLI de skills](https://github.com/vercel-labs/skills) mencionada arriba con `--agent bob`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clone / Copy {#clone--copy}"
msgstr "Clonar / Copiar {#clone--copy}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-19
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "If your agent does not support a native plugin or the skills CLI, clone this repo and copy the desired skill directory to the agent's supported skill directory:\n"
msgstr "Si tu agente no admite un plugin nativo ni la CLI de skills, clona este repositorio y copia el directorio de la skill deseada al directorio de skills que admite el agente:\n"

